# Build output
.vs/
obj/
bin/
cache/
*.user
*.cache
*.log
~$*.xlsx

# Release artifacts. The single-file exe belongs on GitHub Releases, not in the tree; the
# Lexicon folder is regenerated beside it on every publish.
Distribution/

# The public mirror lives in Publish/ as its own repository; never nest it inside this one.
Publish/

# === Large development-only data, not tracked ===
# The product (KinshipCalculator.Core + UI) reads only Resource/Data/Lexicon/*.yaml, which
# is embedded in the assembly. Everything below is comparison/verification scaffolding that
# the shipped exe never needs.
#
# mumuy source data (MIT, see ATTRIBUTION.md). Our engine is generative and does not consult
# its table; these are needed only to re-run the local comparison. ~47 MB.
Utility/MumuyAlgorithm/Data/mode-map.json
Utility/MumuyAlgorithm/Data/cache.json
Utility/MumuyAlgorithm/Data/kinship_terms.yaml

# The 90k comparison face (TSV 72.9 MB / XLSX 10.7 MB) is a derived product, regenerable via
# Utility/Scripts/Run-ValidationLoop.ps1. The 438-row main face (MumuyMainAccuracyCompact.*)
# is the hand-adjudicated safety net and stays tracked.
Resource/Data/Reference/MumuyModeMapAccuracyCompact.tsv
Resource/Data/Reference/MumuyModeMapAccuracyCompact.xlsx
Resource/Data/Reference/MumuyModeMapAccuracyCompact.Unsupported.tsv

# Derived-by-tooling files that a fresh clone generates on first validation run —
# without these repo-level entries the second run trips its own dirty gate on machines
# lacking a global gitignore.
*.pre-refresh.bak
__pycache__/
Distribution.staging-*/
Distribution.parked-*/
Distribution.old-*/
packages.lock.json
